//             '<p>The internationally renowned English singer and pianist, Elton John (real name Reginald Kenneth Dwight), has led a successful career since he released his first album back in 1969. Over more than 40 years, Elton John has sold more than 300m albums and 100m singles to his horde of adoring fans all over the world! A true superstar and piano virtuoso, winning a scholarship and an honorary doctorate from the Royal Academy of Music in London, Elton has released a tsunami of hits, penned jointly with his accomplice, Bernie Taupin: "Candle in the Wind", "Your Song", "Rocket Man ", "Crocodile Rock", "Goodbye Yellow Brick Road", "Don\'t Go Breaking My Heart", "I\'m Still Standing", "Nikita" and "Sacrifice"! With more than 5000 gigs under his belt, he enraptures audiences with his legendary positive energy, ability to improvise, vocal range, and the diversity of his catalogue.</p>',
